  "worked_solution": "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} \\\\ -2+\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+\\frac{2-\\text{i}}{1+2\\text{i}}{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} \\\\ -2+\\text{i}+\\frac{(2-\\text{i})(1+2\\text{i})}{1+2\\text{i}} & \\text{i}+\\frac{(2-\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})}{1+2\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & \\frac{(\\text{i}-2)+(3+\\text{i})}{1+2\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result  is \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
